<metadata xml:lang="en"><idinfo><citation><citeinfo><origin>Rookery Bay NERR</origin><pubdate>2006</pubdate><title>RookeryBayNERR2011b</title><geoform Sync="TRUE">vector digital data</geoform><onlink>www.rookerybay.org</onlink><ftname Sync="TRUE">rookery-nerrboundary</ftname></citeinfo></citation><descript><abstract>The boundary represents the area managed by Rookery Bay NERR as described in the Florida Statutes (Chapter 258). The managed area is composed of the Rookery Bay Aquatic Preserve, Cape Romano/Ten Thousand Islands Aquatic Preserve and Deltona Settlement Agreement Lands.  The boundary was updated in 2011 to coincide with updated Aquatic Preserve boundaries.</abstract><purpose>To provide visual representation of the legal description for the areas managed by Rookery Bay NERR.</purpose><supplinf>none</supplinf><langdata Sync="TRUE">en</langdata></descript><timeperd><timeinfo><sngdate><caldate>2006</caldate></sngdate></timeinfo><current>publication date</current></timeperd><status><progress>Complete</progress><update>As needed</update></status><spdom><bounding><westbc Sync="TRUE">-81.804560</westbc><eastbc Sync="TRUE">-81.451908</eastbc><northbc Sync="TRUE">26.098746</northbc><southbc Sync="TRUE">25.826509</southbc></bounding><lboundng><leftbc Sync="TRUE">619761.304895</leftbc><rightbc Sync="TRUE">654460.044258</rightbc><bottombc Sync="TRUE">205120.295583</bottombc><topbc Sync="TRUE">234667.877054</topbc></lboundng></spdom><keywords><theme><themekt>none</themekt><themekey>Aquatic Preserve Boundaries</themekey><themekey>Cape Romano/Ten Thousand Islands Aquatic Preserve</themekey><themekey>Rookery Bay Aquatic Preserve</themekey><themekey>Rookery Bay NERR managed boundary</themekey><themekey>Deltona land</themekey></theme><place><placekey>United States</placekey><placekey>Southeast</placekey><placekey>Florida</placekey><placekey>Collier County</placekey><placekey>Naples</placekey><placekey>Rookery Bay NERR</placekey></place></keywords><accconst>none</accconst><useconst>Not for legal use.  For illustrative purposes only. Proper citation of the data is required.</useconst><ptcontac><cntinfo><cntperp><cntper>Jill Schmid</cntper><cntorg>Rookery Bay NERR</cntorg></cntperp><cntpos>GIS Specialist</cntpos><cntaddr><addrtype>mailing and physical address</addrtype><address>300 Tower Road</address><city>Naples</city><state>FL</state><postal>34113</postal><country>USA</country></cntaddr><cntvoice>(239) 417-6310</cntvoice><cntfax>(239) 417-6315</cntfax><cntemail>jill.schmid@dep.state.fl.us</cntemail><hours>Monday - Friday, 8:30 am - 5:00 pm, Eastern Time</hours></cntinfo></ptcontac><datacred>Rookery Bay National Estuarine Research Reserve</datacred><secinfo><secclass>Unclassified</secclass></secinfo><native Sync="TRUE">Microsoft Windows XP Version 5.1 (Build 2600) Service Pack 3; ESRI ArcCatalog 9.3.1.3000</native><natvform Sync="TRUE">Shapefile</natvform></idinfo><dataqual><attracc><attraccr>not applicable</attraccr></attracc><logic>Although no tests were performed, the data are believed to be logically consistent.</logic><complete>All lines of boundaries have been included to the best of our knowledge.</complete><posacc><horizpa><horizpar>These are not legally binding boundaries since neither survey nor GPS of boundary corners has been completed.</horizpar></horizpa></posacc><lineage><srcinfo><srccite><citeinfo><pubdate>1995</pubdate><title>Florida Statutes</title></citeinfo></srccite><typesrc>paper</typesrc><srccitea>Florida Statutes</srccitea><srccontr>legal description of the Aquatic Preserve boundaries.</srccontr></srcinfo><procstep><procdesc>Based on the legal descriptions in the Statutes, appropriate section lines were hand digitized following the section/township/range map which were digitized from the USGS Quad map.  Deltona settlement property boundary was then merged to the Statute boundary.  The high tide line in the vicinity of the Ten Thousand Islands was derived from an FGDL file.  This high tide line was merged to the S